{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>The first of the first fruits of your land you shall bring.</b> By this you will attain success in your produce, as it says: וְרֵאשִׁית כָּל בִּכּוּרֵי כֹל תִּתְּנוּ לַכֹּהֵן לְהָנִיחַ בְּרָכָה אֶל בֵּיתֶךָ (Ezekiel 44:30)." "<b>You shall not boil a kid.</b> Like the practice of the nations, who think to attain by this very means success in produce or in livestock."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:09.708530069Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}